Antiviral NP-virus binding theory for the JCP paper.

Files:
  parameters.py       - Parameters dataclass (replaces the old data dictionary)
  theory.py           - All physics functions (equations referenced in the paper)
  run_calculations.py - Parameter sweep driver script
  test_regression.py  - Regression tests against golden reference

Run: python run_calculations.py
Test: python test_regression.py test

Version history (old files in git history):
  v1-v4: Early iterations with formula refinements
  v6: Working implementation with new formulas
  v7: Vectorisation attempt
  v8: Bisection for pL equation (stable, always converges)
  Current: Refactored from v8 — same math, cleaner structure
